# roro happy
[#hide_name] [#happy] Roro: You can hear the two start bickering behind you but you don’t care! You dig into the stale pizza with a satisfied smile on your face. 
As you continue to eat your meal, a heap of dirty newspapers get launched into YOUR dumpster! You look over, appalled, and see an offensive article ripped to shreds. 
# roro thinking
[#thinking] Hmm, what does this say? 
You pick up the newspaper and start to read. Curiosity might've killed the cat, but you’re a raccoon!
# roro surprised
[#surprised] Roro: Yadah, yadah, yadah, new freeway being built finally. 
Roro: Wait, they are selling rye bread for $60??? Who is dumb enough to buy that?
As you continue to read you come across an article describing recent sightings of rats and pigeons fighting. 
Roro: Wow, lotsa big words here.
“LAND V. SKY RATS, WHO WILL WIN! Scientists in New York City have seen a startling rise the war-like violence is between pigeons and rats. Many civilians have reported seeing rats and pigeons fighting across entire streets, delaying traffic for hours. This indicates a positive correlation between the city's overall mass hysteria and the ecological...” 
The rest of the words blur together, as you wisely decide to not read anymore, lest you get a headache with all the big words.
Roro: They're still going at it? How many years have the rats and pigeons been fighting for? I forget. Not my dumpster, not my trash. I value my piece of mind ya know.
# roro thinking
[#thinking] You continue to read the article and come across another article describing problems involving the skyscraper lights and tunnel system plumbing. 
