# roro happy
[#happy] With the newspaper now finished, you lick your paws clean from the pizza sauce and lift your nose to the sky.
# roro surprised
[#surprised] You sniff the air and GASP, the smell of a lovely apple pie enters your nostrils. 
# roro neutral
[#neutral] You follow your nose, deeper into the alleyway, ready to feast on the dessert. But suddenly a loud BANG is heard, followed by a smaller bang. 
You stop midstep and whip your head over to the noise. Your interest is piqued and you immediately change course. 
As you continue deeper into the alleyway, you can pick up pieces of a hushed conversation. 
[#neutral] Macaron: Are you sure? I don't want to take food away from you...
Xiu: Yes, Macaron!! I made this for you!
Macaron: You made it?!
Xiu: I poured my heart and soul into this pie, because [i]you're[/i] the apple of [i]my[/i] eye.
Macaron: Coo!!!
Macaron's feathers explode up into her face, prompting her to hide them.
# roro surprised
[#surprised] Roro: Woah… This is beautiful! To share food with your mortal enemy under the cover of alleyway darkness!!!!!
You continue to watch their conversation and it’s filled with LOVE.
[#neutral] Macaron: W-Well, I made you this!
The pigeon thrusts a meticulously beak(?)-crafted flower crown into Xiu's paws.
Xiu: Wow, flowers? 
# roro neutral
[#neutral] Roro: How the heck did she find flowers in the concrete jungle?
# roro surprised
[#surprised] Macaron: I scoured every sky, from dusk to dawn, just to find flowers to rival your beaut!
Xiu bashfully starts twirling her tail while looking demure. Her flustered gaze was directed downward, overwhelmed by the display of affection. 
Xiu: Oooooh! 
Roro: Jeez, even my parents weren’t this mushy gushy with each other!
Macaron and Xiu continue to profess their love to each other as you watch from your super secret hiding place, the disturbed dumpster. 
# roro neutral
[#neutral] Roro: Wow... I didn't think such aggressive species were capable of love.
Roro: But today I was proven wrong! I had no idea that THE rat princess Xiu was hiding a forbidden romance like this.
